meta {
  name: Face Enroll
  type: http
  seq: 21
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/hr/attendance/face/enroll
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "user_id": "{{userId}}",
    "consent": true
  }
}

docs {
  The reference photo is NOT sent here — it is the user's avatar, uploaded first
  via identity-service (POST /users/me/photo or /users/:id/photo). Enroll reads
  that stored photo and registers it with CompreFace.

  A member may enroll THEMSELVES (user_id === caller); hr_admin/org_admin may
  enroll anyone in-org. `consent` MUST be true (DPDP) — false returns 422
  FACE_CONSENT_REQUIRED. With no avatar on file: 400 FACE_NO_PHOTO. Self-service
  re-enrolment within the org's cooldown: 422 FACE_CHANGE_COOLDOWN (admins bypass).
  subject id === user UUID; re-enrolling replaces faces.
}
